{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_ex02_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_ex02","title":"南轅北轍","storyCode":"CB-EX2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_ex02_end.txt","sourceHash":"3c151533b85d434f8ba8c1fc387747beb7748ea4a7ccaff02ccad62ef8f972aa","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"負傷逃離龍門的甘比諾與卡彭再次在小徑相遇，而他們的決鬥依然慣例般的中斷——有不速之客出現在了二人面前。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，是你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"他們怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過，這座城市不需要流血，他們要是能逃得出去，就讓他們逃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"懷念舊主是好事，你們用自己的效忠換來了其他同伴生存的權利，說明你們尚存良知，但千萬不要奢求更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......是、是的。但是後來的事情，已經明顯僭越了龍門的規矩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你們學的倒是挺快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說，遠在敘拉古成為今天的模樣之前，那時還必須苟且為生的黑手黨之間，流傳著一些默認的法則。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"人人遵循，人人默許，在波濤洶湧的時局之中，黑手黨反倒成為了最守信用的團體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"他們販賣人情，四處兜售戰爭，最終走到了今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門有龍門的律憲，我有我的規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝物流也有他們自己那一套為所欲為的法則，只不過各不相同罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王先生，如果當時首領......甘比諾先生不在第一次見面的時候拔劍的話，事情會演變到這一步嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我給過機會，在那之前之後，遠不止那一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但有些時候，特別是談生意的場合，第一印象是非常重要的，明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼，呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"出口......在那......！就快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"——誰！？出來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你沒死，真是意外，看來鼠王辦事也並非那麼徹底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......被你刺傷的傷口還隱隱作痛，卡彭，我非常高興你會主動出現在我的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"好讓我親手殺了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"整個龍門都在追捕我們。我不想浪費時間在你身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，速戰速決吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你會為背叛家族付出代價——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，家族，家族呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真是讓人懷念的說法，嗯，你們見到德克薩斯了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這個氣味......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......落單的狼。你為什麼會在龍門？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"因為德克薩斯在這裡，這不是顯而易見的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"話說，原來拖家帶口地逃離敘拉古還能有資格自稱家族？還有資格自稱“西西里人”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼那位掠奪了你們引以為傲的榮光和歷史的......西西里女士本人，同意了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"——住嘴！不要在我面前提起那個女人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是一個叛徒，你沒資格對我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，廢物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，原來你們受傷了？熟悉的血腥味，狼血，嗯，這就是所謂的家鄉的味道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯變了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"她真的變得太多太多了，敘拉古的老朋友找上門來，而她居然讓你們活著離開了龍門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"這也太不講究待客之道了，不可能的吧？但是沒關係，她沒有做的事情，我會來幫她善後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"也許把敘拉古同僚的屍首擺在她的面前，能稍微刺激到她一點，是呢，真是個好主意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"你們覺得她逃得掉嗎？從她家族的陰影裡，從那段過去裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡彭，給我站穩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你竟然會和我並肩作戰？你的榮耀和家族呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"念在你避開了要害的份上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你在害怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"我唯獨不願死在她的手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......有點道理，就算要死，我也希望留下一具全屍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，你們都在發抖哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"站都站不穩了還想要和我戰鬥嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯，真不錯，親眼目睹垂死掙扎也是不錯的消遣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，給你們十秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"char_140_whitew","isRemote":false,"text":"逃吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_140_whitew","aliases":["拉普蘭德"]}]}
